    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>Kassa Fabrication sells only to buyers who can afford the best, and the Armageddon is its shotgun. It is an older design than the Alliance's current issue, heavier and harder to control, but it carries six shells, holds a tight pattern at longer range, and was machined to tolerances few manufacturers attempt.</p><p><strong>Grades:</strong> This weapon rolls one more damage die at elite grade (a greater striking rune in Pathfinder) and a second at paragon grade (major striking).</p>"
